window.__T__=[{"i":4480,"text":"Create a photorealistic 3:4 vertical at-home portrait with the authentic texture of a casual smartphone snapshot. A clearly adult woman, approximately 23 to 29 years old, is standing in front of a white countertop in a compact modern home kitchen. Frame her from the head to roughly the middle of the thighs. She has a soft oval face, a narrow jaw and chin, a delicate straight nose bridge, naturally straight brows, and almond-shaped eyes. Preserve her original facial proportions, recognizability, natural asymmetry, and quiet expression rather than redesigning her into a celebrity or generic influencer.\n\nHer head tilts slightly toward image-right while she looks steadily into the camera. Her eyes feel alert but relaxed, and her lips rest slightly apart as though she had almost spoken before pausing. Use sheer nude makeup associated with contemporary East Asian urban fashion contexts: lightweight semi-matte foundation, softly defined brown brows, fine brown-black tightlining, separated natural lashes, muted beige-brown eyeshadow, a trace of peach blush, and diffused coral-pink nude lips. Retain faint pores, natural tonal variation, and non-uniform skin texture.\n\nHer hair is long, side-parted, and deep chocolate brown, with soft chestnut highlights under the warm household light. The roots have mild volume, and most of the hair falls over the shoulder on image-left in broad, loose, slightly irregular curls. Leave several delicate face-framing strands near the ear and cheek. The hand on image-left lightly holds the ends of one section of hair, allowing the strands to separate casually between her fingers. The hand on image-right rests behind her on the countertop and supports part of her weight.\n\nHer body leans subtly toward image-right while her hips shift slightly in the opposite direction. The shoulders are not perfectly level, and the torso and hips have a small, natural twist that creates a restrained S-shaped line. Keep the pose loose and believable rather than making her forcefully lift her chest, contract her stomach, or arch her hips.\n\nShe wears a muted peach-nude or pale salmon fitted camisole with thin straps and a low rounded-square neckline. The material should resemble soft cotton jersey or stretch knit. It follows the body while retaining believable thickness and gravity: the chest area remains smooth, the side waist shows slight tension, and several horizontal folds gather naturally around the waist and lower torso. Pair it with high-rise fitted jeans in washed charcoal black or deep graphite gray, featuring prominent white or pale-gray contrast stitching, clearly outlined front pockets, a structured waistband, metal button, zipper fly, faint washed tonal variation, and real denim creases. Add a very fine warm-gold short necklace with a tiny pendant and a pale nude-pink or milky-white manicure.\n\nVisible skin includes the face, ears, neck, collarbones, shoulders, upper edge of the chest, both arms, wrists, hands, and fingers. The rest of the chest, abdomen, waist, hips, and legs remain covered. Use a light warm ivory skin tone with subtle peach and beige undertones. The skin should look as though it would feel soft, warm, smooth, and finely textured to the touch. Keep it mostly softly matte, with low natural sheen on the forehead, nose bridge, collarbones, shoulders, and forearms. Preserve extremely subtle pores around the cheeks and nose and avoid a plastic or porcelain surface.\n\nThe background is a tidy but lived-in modern kitchen with glossy warm-white cabinetry, a pale gray-beige recessed cooking area, a wide black range hood or horizontal black strip behind the subject's head, a white countertop, a black gas cooktop, a wok or pan with a pale gray-green lid, and a transparent cooking-oil bottle with a yellow cap near the wall on image-right. A built-in appliance panel is partially visible beneath the counter. Keep these background details recognizable rather than heavily blurred.\n\nShoot with the visual character of a smartphone rear main camera or a phone on a fixed support, using approximately a 26 to 30mm full-frame-equivalent perspective from 1.3 to 1.8 meters away. The camera height sits between her chest and eyes and tilts only very slightly downward. Keep the framing mostly centered but not geometrically perfect, with limited space above her head and her arms and hips approaching the side edges.\n\nLight the scene with a mixture of warm residential ceiling light, reflections from the pale cabinets, and broad frontal room ambience. Do not use professional rim lighting or a polished three-point setup. Let the shoulder and arm on image-right appear slightly brighter, while shallow warm shadows remain beneath the chin, around the neck, along the inner arms, and beside the waist. Use relatively deep smartphone-camera focus so the kitchen remains legible. Add mild mobile denoising, subtle JPEG and social-media compression, a warm white balance, and a small amount of low-light texture instead of cinematic color grading.\n\nShe had just paused at the kitchen counter and casually gathered the hair resting over her shoulder. She is looking into the lens now, and in the next moment she seems about to release the ends and turn back toward what she had been doing. The atmosphere is warm, quiet, restrained, and intimate, like a familiar person casually taking a photograph before dinner.\n\nAvoid: underage appearance, mirror selfie, visible phone, celebrity face replacement, exaggerated breasts, extreme waist-to-hip proportions, unnaturally long legs, plastic skin, excessive smoothing, cold blue grading, hard studio light, dramatic rim light, strong artificial bokeh, overprocessed HDR, CGI texture, stiff fingers, extra limbs, text, watermarks, and logos.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/49238_out.png"]},{"i":4481,"text":"A luxury editorial sports campaign poster featuring an elegant female model inspired by the national identity of [Country].\n\nShe wears avant-garde football couture rather than a traditional jersey, combining architectural tailoring, premium sportswear elements, structured pleated garments, performance-inspired details, glossy technical fabrics, and refined fashion accessories, all designed around the country's signature color palette.\n\nThe camera uses an extreme low-angle perspective with elongated fashion proportions, creating heroic long legs, a powerful runway stride, and an iconic commercial silhouette. Her expression is calm, confident, and sophisticated, looking slightly downward toward the viewer like a luxury brand ambassador.\n\nBehind her stands a monumental low-poly geometric sculpture representing the nation's symbolic animal or emblem, rendered in faceted architectural forms and integrated seamlessly into the white studio environment.\n\nThe entire scene takes place inside a minimalist seamless white cyclorama studio with museum-quality presentation, high-key soft lighting, clean shadows, and premium advertising photography aesthetics.\n\nStrict visual consistency throughout the composition: background, sculpture, garments, accessories, typography, and props all follow the country's signature colors. The image feels like a collaboration between FIFA, Nike, Balenciaga, and a world-class fashion magazine.\n\nUltra-premium branding aesthetic. Editorial masterpiece. Hero poster. Luxury commercial campaign. Clean composition. Strong negative space. High-end CGI-assisted fashion photography. 8K. Hyper detailed.\n\n将宽高比设为 9:16","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/49185_out.png","https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/49185_in0.png"]},{"i":4482,"text":"(My Hero Academia art style), (embedding:lazypos), (white background, bright backlight), blurry background, bokeh, floating blue particles,\n\n1boy, (young man, bald, glowing bright blue eyes, sharp eyes, neutral cool expression:0.95),\n\n(UA Hero School Uniform, hands in pockets:0.95), (tall, muscular physique, broad shoulders, wide chest),\n\n(cool blue lighting, dramatic rim lighting, strong backlighting, ethereal atmosphere:1.1), light particles, blue crystal shards","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/49095_out.png"]},{"i":4483,"text":"A young adult woman with pastel pink twin ponytails, wearing a black-and-white lace maid-inspired dress, seated in a slightly cluttered café corner or styling backstage area. She presses a black and vivid pink demon-rabbit plush beside her cheek. Her styling has a refined anime-inspired, doll-like quality while the photograph retains the authenticity of a casual smartphone snapshot.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/48390_out.png"]},{"i":4484,"text":"1個女孩,獨奏、傑作、最佳品質、超細緻、動畫藝術風格、鮮豔色彩、電影燈光、可愛的貓耳女孩,搭配長篇雜亂的黑色頭髮與藍色眼睛,微笑、看著觀眾、製作貓爪姿勢、穿著厚重的藍色爪子手套搭配金色星星圖案、精美的奇幻偶像禮服搭配白色褶邊與褶邊,飾有金色飾邊與星光熠熠的珠寶,柔美的寢具與蓬鬆的雲朵背景,夢幻般的氛圍,飄飄飄飄飄飄飄的星星,螢光色的星星,螢光,上身。","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/48387_out.png"]},{"i":4485,"text":"Poster iklan makanan cepat saji premium yang mempromosikan DONAT menggunakan tipografi editorial yang besar, komposisi komersial yang bersih, dan estetika branding minimal modern.\n\nSTYLE & ART DIRECTIONS:\nestetika iklan komersial minimal,\nhigh-end FMCG desain kampanye,\nEditorial visual branding makanan cepat saji,\nkomposisi poster media sosial modern,\ngaya iklan studio bersih,\nPinterest-trending estetika kampanye makanan,\nposter tipografi gaya Behance premium,\nsistem branding geometrik yang berani,\nDesain komersial minimal yang berfokus pada produk,\nHigh-contrast editorial fotografi makanan.\n\nMAIN SUBJECT:\nDua nampan / wadah premium dari Do'coffelicious,\nditempatkan secara diagonal di seluruh komposisi,\ntekstur makanan yang terperinci renyah,\ngaya makanan komersial profesional,\nRealisme studio-shot,\nPosisi asimetris dinamis,\nkualitas presentasi premium FMCG,\nHigh-detail rendering tekstur,\nPenampilan yang menarik secara komersial.\n\nLayout & komposisi:\nMempertahankan struktur komposisi yang sama sebagai referensi:\nLogo merek yang berpusat di atas,\nnampan atas diposisikan secara diagonal di area kiri atas,\nnampan bawah diposisikan secara diagonal di area kanan bawah,\nTipografi berukuran besar yang terintegrasi di belakang dan di antara produk,\nhuruf-huruf besar yang dipotong yang meluas di luar bingkai,\nkeseimbangan ruang negatif yang kuat,\nKomposisi editorial asimetris,\nritme visual yang bersih,\ngerakan mata zig-zag dinamis,\nPremium Spacing Hierarchy (Hierarchia spasi premium).\n\nTipografi:\nExtra-bold geometric sans-serif tipografi,\nOversized cropped text composition (komposisi teks yang dipangkas)\ncampuran solid-fill dan tipografi garis besar,\neditorial besar-besaran,\nkata-kata minimal dengan dampak visual maksimum,\nhierarki tipografi FMCG modern,\nGaya branding kontemporer yang bersih,\nTipografi berfungsi sebagai elemen komposisi.\n\nKedalaman & Pencahayaan:\nPencahayaan studio komersial profesional,\nbayangan yang realistis lembut,\npencahayaan overhead yang bersih,\nPeningkatan tekstur detail tinggi,\nPermukaan renyah menyoroti,\nkedalaman fotografi makanan premium,\nminimum soft-grey shadow casting,\nGaya pencahayaan iklan mewah. Gaya pencahayaan iklan mewah. Gaya pencahayaan iklan mewah. Gaya pencahayaan iklan mewah.\n\nRincian Desain Ekstra:\nBackground minimal bersih,\ngrafik branding nampan kertas yang halus,\ndesain kemasan high-end,\nPoster Editorial Balance,\nPenggunaan white space yang kuat,\nRealisme komersial premium,\nestetika kampanye media sosial modern,\nminimal clutter grafis,\nPemisahan produk yang tajam,\nIklan yang bersih selesai.\n\nPalet Warna:\nDominansi warna merek utama,\nnada makanan hangat kontras tinggi,\nlatar belakang putih / abu-abu terang yang bersih,\nPalet yang dikontrol minimal,\nWarna tipografi yang konsisten dengan merek,\nBlokir warna modern yang berani.\n\nKualitas:\nUltra-high - resolution rendering komersial,\nKualitas iklan premium 8K,\nPresentasi kampanye tingkat Behance,\nPinterest-trending estetika FMCG,\nKomposisi editorial profesional,\nRealisme poster komersial mewah,\nintegrasi tipografi high-end,\nAward-winning Advertising Art Direction.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/48233_out.png"]},{"i":4486,"text":"Vertical quirky flat cartoon portrait of [HUMAN] with a tall geometric head, long narrow neck, oversized circular eyes, tiny mouth and deadpan [EXPRESSION], wearing [CLOTHING], with [ANIMAL] perched on top of the hair like a living hat. Clean black outline drawing, flat color fills, simple facial shapes, sparse sketch marks on the animal fur or skin, playful surreal character design, bold graphic [PALETTE] palette. Background scenery: [SCENERY], drawn with simplified shapes, clear depth, small environmental props and clean cartoon perspective. Crisp digital illustration, poster-like vertical framing, no realism, no 3D render, no painterly shading, aspect ratio 4:5.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/48169_out.png"]},{"i":4487,"text":"2x2 grid, 16:9, do this for 4 famous classic cars that look strange: class HybridStyleGenerator: def __init__(self): self.subject = \"[YOUR SUBJECT HERE]\" self.parents = { \"structure_parent\": \"Art Deco poster design — geometric symmetry, sunburst rays, stepped architecture, streamlined borders\", \"texture_parent\": \"Vintage screenprint — distressed ink, halftone dots, registration errors, paper grain, worn edges\", \"energy_parent\": \"Sports graphic dynamism — paint splatters, motion fragments, layered transparency, explosive color bursts\", \"detail_parent\": \"3D clay diorama — soft tactile surfaces, miniature craft aesthetic, warm polymer textures, pop-up depth\" } self.mutations = { \"medium_mutation\": \"Physical poster that appears to be peeling away to reveal clay miniature underneath\", \"information_mutation\": \"Geometric Deco borders fracture into paint splatters that solidify into 3D clay forms\", \"semantic_mutation\": \"The flat graphic design gains dimensional depth as if emerging from the page\", \"scale_mutation\": \"Heroic poster scale collapses into intimate handmade diorama in the center\" } self. style_mix = { \"structure_parent\": 0.30, \"texture_parent\": 0.25, \"energy_parent\": 0.25, \"detail_parent\": 0.15, \"mutations\": 0.05 } def generate_subject(self): subject = \"\"\" Create a vertical poster that merges heroic propaganda design with intimate craft aesthetic. The composition should have strong Art Deco geometric framework with sunburst rays and stepped patterns. Apply distressed screenprint texture throughout — visible halftone dots, ink variations, paper wear. Explode dynamic paint splatters and fragmented geometric shards radiating from the central subject. The center should reveal a soft 3D clay miniature version of the subject, as if the poster is a window into a tactile diorama world. Color palette: Bold patriotic red/blue/white from propaganda posters, but softened with warm clay tones (terracotta, cream, sage green). Paint splatters in electric cyan and magenta. The design must feel like a vintage sports poster that was handcrafted by a miniature artist. \"\"\" return render( subject, style_mix=self. style_mix, format=\"vertical poster, 24x36 inches\", typography=\"\"\" Bold condensed sans-serif headline with screenprint distress Secondary text in Art Deco geometric letterforms Handwritten clay-label tags on miniature elements \"\"\", composition=\"\"\" Strong vertical symmetry with Deco border framework Radiating energy bursts breaking the symmetry Central focal point with 3D depth illusion Layered transparency creating dimensional space \"\"\", lighting=\"\"\" Flat graphic lighting for poster elements Soft studio lighting for clay miniature center Dramatic rim lighting on paint splatter fragments \"\"\", constraints=\"\"\" No photorealism except in clay texture Maintain graphic boldness at thumbnail size Distress should feel authentic, not digital filter Clay elements must look genuinely handcrafted \"\"\" ) # Execute generation HybridStyleGenerator().generate_subject()","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/48112_out.png"]},{"i":4488,"text":"[Title]: [custom]\n[Series Name]: [Wind Field Portraits / custom]\n[Subject]: [e.g. young East Asian woman]\n[Outfit]: [e.g. black knit dress / white dress / dark green long dress]\n[Scene]: [e.g. grass field / reed field / hillside / coastal grassland]\n[Weather]: [e.g. overcast / stormy / strong wind]\n[Mood]: [e.g. quiet / cold / distant]\n[Color Tonel: [e.g. grey-green low saturation / film-like]\n[Aspect Ratio]: [e.g. 3:4 | 4:5 / 9:16]\nCreate a cinematic outdoor editorial portrait poster titled [Title] from the series [Series Name].\nShow [Subject] in [Outfit], standing in [Scene] under [Weather], with strong wind moving through her hair and the surrounding grass.\nHer expression should feel [Mood], with realistic skin, natural hair strands, and a vivid lifelike presence.\nUse blurred foreground plants for depth, muted [Color Tonel tones, subtle film grain, and a quiet fashion-editorial mood.\nVertical composition in [Aspect Ratio].\nAdd original minimal white typography at the bottom with a custom main title, subtitle, and slogan.\nDo not copy any text from the reference images.\nAvoid e-commerce posing, fake beauty retouching, oversaturated colors, and cheap poster design.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/48111_out.png"]},{"i":4489,"text":"Create a 4:5 full-bleed editorial action poster for STRIKE SPORT. The brand’s visual identity follows these must-visible traits: a bright outdoor photograph with a clear open sky dominating a large portion of the frame; enormous warm-cream extra-condensed block letters cropped by the canvas and sitting behind the main subject; one oversized action figure cutting diagonally across the layout and breaking through the text layer; a low or close wide-angle camera angle that makes the foreground feel physically imposing; secondary text, large numerals, or stacked words in cream placed along bottom and side edges; compact white editorial microcopy in short tight clusters anchored to strong grid positions; one vivid accent color concentrated on the hero product or outfit while the environment stays sky-blue and neutral; hard midday sunlight with crisp shadows and high-contrast edges; a layered structure alternating between flat graphic type and real photography; minimal ornament — only small marks, rules, or separators; a dense, kinetic layout with the action dominant, type second, and microcopy third. Scene: A professional boxer is throwing a powerful hook with boxing gloves in an outdoor rooftop boxing ring in a modern city, surrounded by ropes, subtle training equipment, drifting dust particles, and a distant skyline under a clear sky. Camera & Composition: Low close wide-angle outdoors, oversized foreground scale, decisive frozen motion, one strong diagonal movement from lower left to upper right, subject cropped by at least one canvas edge. Typography: Place massive warm-cream ultra-condensed block sans lettering reading STRIKE SPORT behind the subject, filling over half the canvas, cropped by the frame and partially hidden by the action. Add compact white microcopy reading ROUND 01 / FIGHT HARD / POWER IN MOTION in tight editorial blocks. Include a small generic glove mark symbol and bottom information clusters in cream. Wardrobe: Modern athletic boxing gear, black base with sharp red accent details, tight performance fit, sweat-textured realism. Brand colors: saturated sky-blue or cyan dominant, warm cream type, crisp white microcopy, deep shadows, one vivid red accent on the gloves and highlights. Lighting & Finish: Hard midday sun, crisp shadows, high-contrast commercial photo realism, slight print-grain texture. No illustration, 3D rendering, real logos, or watermarks. Avoid: real brand logos, watermarks, QR codes, comic or halftone effects, dark studio scenes, muted palettes, or a tiny distant subject. Generate as a 4K ultra-high-resolution raster image.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/48109_out.png"]},{"i":4490,"text":"9:16 vertical — a 3x3 grid collage (nine images) forming a Korean idol portrait photoshoot series. Each frame features the same young Korean female idol, maintaining 100% consistency in facial features, proportions, hairstyle, and identity across all nine shots. Natural, ultra-realistic skin texture, no retouching, no smoothing. Clean idol-style minimal makeup, soft glow, subtle imperfections. Hair: long, voluminous dark hair, slightly tousled, consistent across all frames (natural loose flow, slight movement). Outfit: cohesive Korean idol photoshoot styling — white shirt + short bottoms (or simple neutral-toned outfit), youthful, clean, slightly casual but styled. Same outfit across all frames. Setting: minimal studio or simple indoor environment (plain wall, soft window light, clean background). Focus on subject, not environment. Lighting: soft diffused natural light, gentle highlights, low contrast, slightly airy tones, subtle film-like softness. Camera style: intimate portrait photography, slightly handheld feel, subtle imperfections (minor grain, slight blur in motion frames, imperfect framing). Frame breakdown (3x3 grid): Top row: - Top left: standing naturally, looking slightly away, relaxed expression - Top center: facing camera, casual mid-motion (hair or body slight movement) - Top right: slight side angle, soft gaze, natural candid feel Middle row: - Center left: looking slightly upward, soft thoughtful expression - Center: close-up portrait, direct eye contact, gentle idol smile - Center right: turning body slightly, mid-motion candid frame Bottom row: - Bottom left: seated or leaning casually, relaxed posture - Bottom center: back partially turned, looking over shoulder toward camera - Bottom right: standing close to frame, slightly playful or soft expression Mood: Korean idol photobook / photocard aesthetic, intimate, soft, natural, everyday charm. Quality: ultra-realistic, 8K detail, subtle analog film grain, natural imperfections, soft dreamy tone","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/47677_out.png"]},{"i":4491,"text":"美麗な2Dアニメーションスタイル（2D anime style）で描かれた、幼稚園の教室（Kindergarten\nclassroom）での、心が温まる日常のワンシーン。彼女は既に成人している設定\n\n隠し撮り風のフレーミング:カメラは、キャラクターの正面に座っている子供たちのさらに後ろ、または物陰から、望遠レンズで狙ったかのような**「隠し撮り・スナップ写真風の構図（Candid\nsnapshot through the crowd）」**を構成している。\n\n画面の最手前（Foreground）には、先生の人形劇を夢中で見つめている**「小さな子供たちの後ろ姿や、頭、肩が大きくボケた状態で写り込んでおり、これが画面のフレーム（枠）のような役割を果たすことで、奥にいるお姉さんを覗き見しているかのような、圧倒的なライブ感とドラマ性を生み出している。\n\n配置とアングル：\n子供たちの頭越し（画面の中央奥）に、床に優しく座り込んでいるお姉さんの姿が、肩から胸元（バストアップ）を中心にクッキリとピントが合った状態（In\nfocus）で捉えられている。カメラを意識していない自然な姿である。\n\n手元の人形（連動したオマージュデザイン：最重要・セーフティ回避）：\n\n彼女は胸の前で、子供たちを大喜びさせるための躍動感のあるおもちゃのアクションを披露している。\nベースの馬の人形（愛馬概念）： 彼女の手には、**「大きくて愛嬌のある丸い目をした、親しみやすい茶色の布製の馬のおもちゃ（A friendly, big-eyed brown toy horse / steed）」**が握られている。その馬は、今まさに元気に走っているかのような躍動感のあるポーズで持ち上げられている。\n乗っているカウボーイ（保安官概念）： そしてその馬の背中（鞍の上）には、**「茶色いカウボーイハットをかぶり、黄色と赤のチェック柄のシャツを着た、小さな西部の保安官風の人形（A small western cowboy doll）」**が、ちょこんと跨って乗せられている。\nお姉さんはこの馬の足をパカパカと走らせるように、**「馬の背中にカウボーイを乗せた状態のまま、上下に楽しげに動かして（Animating the horse running with the cowboy on its back）」**人形劇を進行させている。\n\n表情と衣装（慈愛の真顔）：\n彼女はお気に入りの眼鏡をかけたまま、子供たちをクールながらも見つめている。いつものクールな大人の表情を残しつつも、クールながらも口だけ微笑みが浮かんでおり、子供たちの前だけで見せる特別な母性が表現されている。\n\n【2. 背景（温かみのある現役の教室）】\n背景（お姉さんの後ろ）は、おもちゃの棚やカラフルな壁面飾り、子供たちの描いた絵などが並ぶ、明るく清潔でアットホームな幼稚園の教室の壁 窓から差し込む柔らかな午後の自然光が、先生と子供たちの空間を優しく包み込んでいる。","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/47465_out.png","https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/47465_in0.png"]},{"i":4492,"text":"A clearly adult young woman crouches low beside an outdoor curb, her compact body centered in the frame and her torso leaning toward a close camera. One hand supports her chin in a loose V-shaped gesture as she looks directly into the lens, creating a playful, street-style portrait with a faintly challenging attitude.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/47429_out.png"]},{"i":4493,"text":"16 streetwear editorial advertising poster.Main Subject:The same young male from the reference image.Camera Angle:Extreme low-angle perspective.One hand reaching aggressively toward the camera.Strong foreshortening effect.Pose:Sitting on a low platform.One arm extended toward the lens.Confident attitude.Direct eye contact.Outfit:Oversized black hoodie.Black baggy cargo pants.Black-and-white high-top sneakers.Luxury streetwear styling.Background:Clean white studio backdrop.Typography:Huge oversized black typography reading:\"OWN YOUR PATH\"The typography occupies almost the entire background and is heavily cropped by the frame.Graphic Elements:Red graffiti marker strokes.Sticker labels.White doodle stars.Barcode elements.Paper-cut collage textures.Editorial symbols.Composition:Strong foreground hand.Heroic perspective.Streetwear campaign aesthetic.Lighting:High-contrast fashion photography lighting.Premium studio quality.Sharp shadows.Mood:Fearless.Bold.Confident.Color Palette:White.Black.Red.Aspect Ratio:9:16 vertical.Luxury fashion campaign poster.Ultra detailed.8K masterpiece.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/47412_out.png"]},{"i":4494,"text":"Premium editorial campaign.\nMain Subject: Male model wearing a vivid electric-blue hoodie.\nPose: Slight forward lean with crossed arms.\nCamera: Tight chest portrait.\nBackground: Electric blue studio.\nTypography: \"POWER MODE\".\nLuxury youth campaign.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/47411_out.png"]},{"i":4495,"text":"9:16 vertical fashion editorial photography, photorealistic, top-down overhead shot, lying on lush green grass at night, direct on-camera flash, compact digital camera aesthetic, CCD snapshot style, slight highlight bloom, crisp flash shadows, subtle digital grain, cool low-saturation color grading, deep dark background, nostalgic Y2K street fashion mood, luxury magazine editorial, ultra realistic skin texture, high detail.\n\nA beautiful young adult East Asian woman, clearly adult, delicate oval face, fair porcelain skin, soft natural makeup, warm peach blush, thin eyeliner, almond-shaped eyes, nude matte lips, short black bob haircut tucked behind the ears, calm expression, slightly sleepy and emotionally distant gaze, looking directly at the camera.\n\nShe is lying naturally on a grassy lawn, photographed from directly above. One arm is bent behind her head while the other rests casually beside her body. Her torso twists slightly, creating an elegant S-shaped silhouette. One leg is bent naturally over the other with relaxed posture. Fashion editorial body language, effortless and confident.\n\nOutfit: strapless black bodycon mini dress, fitted silhouette, black baseball cap with subtle embroidered logo, large white over-ear headphones resting around the neck, chunky gold choker necklace, white crew socks with black lettering, oversized matte black rubber rain boots, minimal bracelet.\n\nProps: black leather shoulder bag placed beside her on the grass, casual styling, scattered natural grass texture.\n\nLighting: strong direct flash only, high contrast, bright subject against a nearly black grassy background, subtle flash falloff around the edges, clean skin highlights, natural shadows, premium fashion photography.\n\nComposition: full body, centered composition, editorial magazine cover, negative space around the subject, symmetrical overhead framing, relaxed luxury streetwear aesthetic.\n\n(masterpiece, best quality, ultra detailed, photorealistic, fashion editorial, realistic anatomy, natural body proportions)","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/47410_out.png"]},{"i":4496,"text":"Premium editorial campaign.\nMain Subject: Young male model wearing a vivid turquoise utility jacket.\nPose: Both hands inside pockets while taking a long confident stride.\nCamera: Ground-level tracking shot following the movement.\nBackground: Saturated turquoise seamless studio.\nTypography: \"MOVE FIRST\".\nLuxury fashion editorial. 9:16.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/47408_out.png"]},{"i":4497,"text":"@創作圖像 VTuber 基礎設定藝名：深雪．冰華 (Miyuki Hyouka)稱號：四葉家的絕對冰后 / 現代魔法的頂點歌姬身高：160cm繪師（P站老爹）：石田可奈（風格致敬）粉絲名：CAD齒輪 / 雪結晶🎨 外觀與服裝設計髮型：維持經典的黑色及膝長直髮（黑長直），左側配戴特製的雪花結晶髮夾。眼眸：深邃的冰藍色，開台發動魔法（或談到兄長）時，瞳孔會亮起精神干涉魔法陣的微光。常服（Live2D 初始服裝）：概念：第一高校制服改裝版。細節：白綠相間的優雅連身裙，搭配半透明的薄紗披肩。飾品：右手手腕配戴特製的手槍型變換裝置（CAD）手鐲。新衣裝（付費解鎖解禁版）：概念：四葉家下任家主正裝。細節：純白與深藍交織的十二單和服風禮服，外覆散發幽藍冷光的「悲嘆冥河」冰晶特效。📋 官方設定資料卡項目設定詳細內容初配信紀念日3月25日（魔法科高校入學試驗之日）生年月日2079年3月25日（永遠的16歲優等生）性格標籤高冷端莊、極度兄控、溫柔腹黑、醋勁極強直播主打魔法理論雜談、ASMR（冰塊融化聲）、高難度FPS遊戲直播風格平時用字極致優雅，但提到「哥哥」時會瞬間變成狂熱迷妹。違規懲罰聊天室若有黑粉攻擊達也，會被直接「物理凍結（Ban 24小時）」。🎙️ 直播間特色系統Live2D 特效機制：當觀眾在斗內（Super Chat）稱讚「哥哥（Tatsuya）」時，深雪的背景會飄起溫暖的櫻花與雪花特效。若觀眾對深雪進行過度貼貼（DD行為），背景會瞬間觸發「尼福爾海姆」暴風雪特效，Live2D 臉部會進入黑化（阿黑顏/病嬌）狀態。伴生精靈（吉祥物）：一隻名為「達也大人（Tatsuya-sama）」的三角造型銀色 CAD 機器人，平時飄浮在畫面右上角，會定時幫深雪進行「魔法釋放控制（冷卻聊天室熱度）」。","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/46924_out.png"]},{"i":4498,"text":"A lifestyle environmental portrait captured with a high-end smartphone or compact digital camera, using approximately a 28 to 35 mm full-frame equivalent focal length. Retain mild wide-angle perspective, smartphone HDR shadow recovery, limited highlight latitude, local digital sharpening and faint compression artifacts.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/46744_out.png"]},{"i":4499,"text":"Create a realistic 3:4 vertical environmental portrait with the feeling of an intimate everyday snapshot. An adult woman around 20 to 26 years old is lying on her stomach across a bed layered with rumpled sheets, a red-and-green plaid covering and several brown and charcoal pillows. Both elbows press into the pillows to support her upper body. Her hands meet naturally beneath her chin, fingers overlapping with small irregularities as she holds a plain transparent cylindrical glass containing a little water or a pale drink. Her head is lifted and turned gently toward frame left, while her eyes look past the camera toward the upper-left corner as though she is quietly listening to someone nearby. Her lips are naturally closed or only barely parted. The expression is soft, alert, thoughtful and slightly absent-minded, without direct eye contact or an obvious smile.\n\nHer body extends diagonally toward the upper-right side of the frame. Both knees are bent and her socked feet lift behind her at unequal heights and slightly different angles, preserving the relaxed asymmetry of a real resting pose. She has a small oval face, a soft jawline, large clear eyes, a refined short nose and naturally full lips. Use a restrained doll-inspired makeup direction commonly found in East Asian fashion editorials: a thin fair-toned base with subtle natural texture, muted pink color through the cheeks and central face, narrow brown-black eyeliner, naturally lengthened lashes, softly defined lower-eye fullness, straight relaxed brows and glossy coral-pink or peach-pink lips. Preserve the original facial proportions and avoid a generic influencer face, celebrity replacement or exaggerated youthful appearance.\n\nHer hair is long, deep chocolate brown and nearly black in shadow, styled in broad loose waves with a fragmented straight fringe across the forehead. Keep believable volume at the crown, a few irregular strands and areas compressed against the pillows and body. Direct sunlight should reveal warm chestnut and reddish-brown highlights without making the hair look uniformly curled or wig-like.\n\nShe wears an oversized deep-navy vintage Fair Isle knit top with cream, blue-gray, brick-red and pale-purple snowflake, diamond and zigzag motifs. The material is thick, soft and faintly fuzzy, with loose cuffs, a dropped shoulder line and natural compression folds around the elbows. The lower garment is a warm cream openwork crochet mini skirt or skort with handmade floral openings, a scalloped edge and a small dark tie detail, paired with ivory-white ribbed mid-calf socks featuring ruffled cuffs and relaxed wear creases. The visible skin is limited to the face, a small area of the neck, both hands, fingers and wrists, and a small section of leg between the garment and the socks. Keep the shoulders, chest, waist, abdomen, back, hips and buttocks covered. Her skin is fair with a neutral peach undertone and faint natural pinkness in the cheeks and fingertips. It should appear soft, finely textured and lightly hydrated, with the tactile quality of warm smooth satin while retaining tiny realistic details around the knuckles, palms, nose and facial planes.\n\nPhotograph the scene with the casual realism of a high-end smartphone or compact digital camera using an approximately 26 to 35 mm full-frame equivalent focal length. Place the camera slightly above and in front of the subject at a gentle downward oblique angle, with a small tilt so the body, pillows and lifted feet form a diagonal from lower left to upper right. Keep the face and hands most sharply defined, while the socks, foreground tomatoes and background furniture remain recognizable. Use moderate depth of field rather than aggressive portrait-mode blur. Add a faint retro digital texture, restrained grain, gentle sharpness, small warm color shifts, subtle JPEG character and slight highlight bloom.\n\nStrong warm afternoon sunlight enters directly from a window near the upper-right or front side of the scene. The light strikes her cheek, nose bridge, lips, hands, fingers, socks, small portions of the legs and the bedding, producing clear hard-edged physical shadows. Allow slight translucency along the sunlit edges of the fingers and reflected highlights from the drinking glass near the hands and chin. Do not use an obvious softbox, rim light or evenly balanced fill. Let the dark wooden cabinet and curtain remain in deep shadow, while selected highlights on the pale socks and skin approach mild overexposure.\n\nThe background is a warm, visually rich and slightly cluttered vintage bedroom or sitting space. Include a dark walnut cabinet or shelving unit, worn books, a black round vintage alarm clock, several glass storage jars, a small woven-grille speaker or radio, a wooden bowl of green grapes, a partially visible leafy plant, a retro printed cover featuring red tulips, dark curtains, layered pillows and plaid bedding. In the foreground, place a white plate filled with vivid red cherry tomatoes in direct sunlight, with a cropped green book or magazine entering from the lower edge. Keep the objects unevenly arranged, partially obscured and naturally cropped. Preserve tilted framing, fabric wrinkles, deep shadows, small overexposed patches and the accumulated feeling of a room that has been lived in for years.\n\nThe final image should feel quiet, warm, nostalgic and private, as though someone familiar standing beside the bed captured the moment without preparation. The afternoon light had already crossed the window frame; she had paused while drinking and was still holding the glass when she looked toward someone outside the frame. Avoid an underage appearance, sexualized posing, extra exposed skin, exaggerated body curves, plastic skin, deformed hands or feet, perfectly symmetrical limbs, commercial studio lighting, a minimalist showroom background, excessive blur, text, watermarks and platform logos.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/46729_out.png"]},{"i":4500,"text":"A young adult woman seated beside a café table, taking a close-range smartphone selfie. Long pastel pink hair surrounds her face while one hand supports her cheek. Her upper body is turned slightly away from the camera. She fills most of the frame, with the face acting as the dominant focal point. The image feels like a casual social-media selfie with a subtle character-styling influence.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/46671_out.png"]},{"i":4501,"text":"鸣潮心月狐成年角色真人COS，极简渐变背景高端概念人像，极简时尚封面感 × 高级 editorial 人像 × 独立艺术企划主视觉。\n角色保留原本核心识别点，包括发型、发色、瞳色、服装轮廓、配饰、代表性色彩与气质，并自动转化为更适合真人COS editorial 拍摄的高级造型。服装贴合动作结构，材质具有时尚大片质感，可根据角色气质变化为皮革、丝缎、薄纱、金属饰件、紧身舞台服、改良战斗服或高级定制服装，但整体保持干净、利落、精致，不杂乱。\n\n人物赤脚坐在深色木质栈桥上，露出一双修长的腿，摆出双腿交叉垂、脚尖轻点水面、面对镜头、低头玩水、优雅侧躺、沉思、抬头看天、放空等松弛的动作。\n\n背景是幽暗的水面，漂浮着巨大的绿色荷叶和粉色荷花，以及散落的棕色小陶碗，营造出静谧而神秘的东方幻想氛围。色彩低饱和、高统一度，冷白、雾蓝、浅灰、淡紫、奶油白为主。光线采用柔和棚拍顶光和轻微轮廓光，突出皮肤、发丝、织物和小配饰质感。构图采用高位俯拍视角（High-angle shot），利用广角镜头拉伸腿部线条，增强空间纵深感，焦点清晰落在人物面部与上半身，背景略有景深虚化。\n\n排版自动生成少量标题、副标题、编号、短标语和纵向信息，采用高级极简 typography，细字重、疏字距、克制排布，可出现角色名、project、collection、life catalog、silence、echo、rhythm、delay 等词汇。版式像奢侈品牌 campaign 或先锋杂志封面，不使用廉价大字标题，不做杂乱同人海报。\n\n整体效果像一本先锋时尚杂志封面、奢侈品牌概念 campaign 或角色主题艺术企划海报。画面干净清晰，减少无必要噪点与颗粒感，粒子特效克制，腿部结构自然准确，比例正常，姿态合理，整体细节稳定。","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/45834_out.png"]},{"i":4502,"text":"高品质原创二次元游戏角色插画，商业游戏宣传原画，日系板绘风格，现代军事美学，战术少女，日本现代特种作战风格，日本自卫队特殊作战人员风格，原创角色设计，年轻成年女性，八头身比例，身高约168cm，身材修长紧实，偏敏捷型体格，肩部线条自然，腰腹结实，腿部修长但不过度夸张，整体比例协调，成熟冷静，专业、克制、纪律感强，具有现代特种作战人员气质。\n\n面部具有日本女性特征，与中式、韩式、东欧脸型明显区分，脸型为小巧椭圆脸，略带柔和圆润的下颌线，颧骨不高，脸部轮廓干净细腻，鼻梁自然挺直但不过分高，鼻尖小巧圆润，深棕色眼睛或黑曜石色眼睛，内双或细长杏眼，眼神冷静专注，眉形清晰但不浓重，嘴唇自然，表情沉稳，不甜美，不幼态，不偶像脸。左眼下方有一颗很淡的小痣作为角色辨识特征。\n\n短发，黑色短发或深棕色短发，长度到耳下，利落短鲍勃发型，发尾略带层次，几缕碎发从战术头盔边缘露出，整体干练、清爽、实战感强。\n\n佩戴现代高切战术头盔，日本自卫队二型迷彩或三型迷彩风格头盔罩，夜视仪安装座，头盔导轨系统，主动降噪战术通讯耳机，PTT通讯麦克风，战术护目镜固定于头盔顶部，红外识别灯，头盔配重包，少量伪装布条和迷彩网点缀，头盔侧面带有低调红白识别贴，不出现夸张国旗，不出现真实部队番号，不出现明显文字标识。\n\n身穿日本自卫队二型迷彩 / 三型迷彩风格作战服，绿色、棕色、黑色组成的日式丛林斑点迷彩，现代Combat Shirt战斗衬衫，透气速干黑色作战内层，现代作战长裤，轻量化模块化战术背心，游骑兵绿色或橄榄绿色Plate Carrier，MOLLE挂载系统，胸前三联步枪弹匣包，手枪弹匣包，IFAK医疗包，无线电，PTT通讯器，止血带，烟雾弹包，多功能工具包，战术腰带，快拔手枪套，腿部收纳平台，战术手套，护膝，中帮或高帮战术靴，装备布局紧凑、整洁、实用，符合现代日本特种作战装备风格。\n\n战术装备整体偏轻量化与精确化，不臃肿，不厚重堆叠。装备配色以日本自卫队迷彩、橄榄绿、深绿色、黑色、狼灰色、卡其色为主，少量红白识别色点缀，整体色彩低饱和，冷静克制，具有现代军事质感。尼龙织物、凯夫拉、防弹材料、金属件、橡胶件材质区分明确，装备表面有轻微磨损、泥土痕迹和布料褶皱。\n\n背负小型侦察背包，外挂水袋系统、小型收纳袋、折叠雨披、登山扣、战术绳索、化学荧光棒、多功能军刀，整体装备层次丰富但不过度复杂，没有披风，没有斗篷，没有吉利披肩，没有未来机甲，没有科幻装甲。\n\n手持日本丰和20式5.56mm小铳 / Howa Type 20风格现代突击步枪，符合日本现代制式步枪设计，黑色与橄榄绿色聚合物枪身，深灰色金属部件，顶部皮卡汀尼导轨，现代化护木，可调节枪托，消音器，红点瞄准镜或全息瞄准镜，倍率镜，战术枪灯，激光指示器，双点式枪带，枪械比例真实，结构清晰，符合日本现代特种作战武器风格。腰侧配备Minebea P9风格9mm手枪，手枪置于快拔枪套内，备用弹匣固定在战术腰带上。\n\n角色双手稳定握持步枪，一只手握住握把，一只手托住护木，手部佩戴全指战术手套，五指数量正确，手指自然弯曲，握枪姿势准确，手部结构清晰，不出现多手指，不出现融合手指，不出现畸形手。\n\n背景为日本山地森林与城市反恐训练场结合的环境，潮湿杉树林，苔藓覆盖的岩石，混凝土掩体，废弃训练建筑，湿润地面，雨后薄雾，空气中有细小水汽和尘埃，远处山林被雾气遮挡，冷灰绿色阴天光线，阳光从云层缝隙穿透形成柔和体积光，背景轻微虚化，突出角色主体，整体氛围安静、紧张、专业。\n\n角色微微侧身站立，双手持枪低姿警戒，重心稳定，姿态自然专业，风吹动短发、衣摆和装备绑带，具有战场临场感与商业游戏宣传插画张力。\n\n日系商业板绘风格，原创游戏角色原画，精致线稿，清晰描线，轻厚涂结合赛璐璐渲染，柔和渐变阴影，干净上色，细腻发丝，丰富服装褶皱，真实战术装备细节，优秀的金属与织物材质表现，电影感光影，动态构图，高完成度，高细节，8K，收藏级角色插画，现代战术题材游戏宣传海报。\n\n反向提示词\n多手指，六指，七指，手指畸形，融合手指，断指，手掌变形，错误握枪姿势，多余手臂，多余肢体，人体畸形，比例错误，长发，披风，斗篷，吉利披肩，未来机甲，外骨骼装甲，科幻盔甲，魔法元素，赛博朋克霓虹，过度暴露服装，幼态，Q版，甜美偶像脸，俄罗斯EMR迷彩，美军Multicam主导，中国21式星空迷彩，韩国Granite数字迷彩，AK-12，AR-15主导武器，HK416主导武器，SCAR主导武器，错误国家装备，夸张国旗，真实部队番号，文字，水印，Logo，低质量，模糊，噪点，过曝，塑料质感，3D渲染感。","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/45582_out.png"]},{"i":4503,"text":"Create an authentic 3:4 vertical smartphone photograph taken at an outdoor urban café. A young adult woman, approximately 20 to 26 years old, is sitting diagonally and deeply in a dark brown wooden folding chair. Her hips rest toward the rear of the seat, her back is lightly supported by the chair, and both knees are bent and drawn up onto the seat. One knee sits closer to the camera, producing a believable near-far perspective. She raises both arms above her head, bends her wrists softly and loosely brings her fingers together into an incomplete, slightly asymmetrical heart. The gesture should feel spontaneous and imperfect, as though she improvised it while talking rather than carefully posing.\n\nShe has a chin-length warm chestnut-brown bob with airy straight bangs, lightly flipped-out ends and a few loose strands beside her ears. Direct sunlight falls across the crown, turning selected strands honey-gold and copper. The hair feels fine, soft, naturally voluminous and slightly disordered rather than salon-perfect. She looks directly upward toward the camera with bright eyes, subtle catchlights and gently raised outer corners. Her lips remain softly closed, with only a restrained upward curve, suggesting she might laugh in the next second. Preserve her authentic facial proportions and avoid turning her into a generic influencer face.\n\nUse lightweight everyday makeup inspired by contemporary Korean and Japanese beauty-editorial styling: natural straight brows, fine soft-brown eyeliner, subtly defined lashes and lower eyelids, muted peach blush and soft rosy-beige lips. Keep the base makeup translucent and retain natural tonal variation around the eyes, nose and cheeks.\n\nHer skin is fair with a neutral-warm ivory and peach undertone. Visible skin includes the face, ears, neck, collarbones, a limited upper-chest area above the neckline, both shoulders, both arms and hands, and the thighs and knees exposed beneath the shorts. The waist, abdomen, back and main chest area remain covered. The skin should appear fine-grained, supple and lightly hydrated, as though the sunlit areas would feel gently warm and smooth while shaded areas retain delicate natural fine hair. Preserve mild color variation around the elbows and knees, small moles and subtle imperfections. Do not apply plastic smoothing.\n\nShe wears a fitted warm-white ribbed sleeveless tank top with moderately wide straps and a modest scoop neckline. Add tiny pale-red lettering on the chest, visible ribbed knit texture and natural folds around the waist. The top fully covers the torso and remains opaque. Pair it with light-gray casual shorts, warm-white ribbed knee-high athletic socks and dusty gray-blue retro sneakers with white laces, pale soles and subtle wear creases. Add large thin silver hoop earrings, a pale round-faced wristwatch on one wrist and delicate gold bracelets on the other.\n\nPlace the camera approximately 80 to 120 cm above the subject, tilted downward by around 35 to 45 degrees and shifted slightly toward her front-left. Use the perspective of a rear-facing smartphone 1x main camera, approximately 24 to 28 mm full-frame equivalent, at a close distance. Capture her full body from head to shoes. Position her mainly in the right and lower-middle sections of the frame, with the shoes close to the bottom edge. Let the chair form a strong diagonal through the composition. Allow a stone pillar and rough tree trunk to interrupt the left side of the image, while a woven gray basket partially enters from the lower-right corner. Preserve slight handheld tilt and natural perspective imbalance.\n\nThe background is a real outdoor café terrace with warm beige-gray stone columns, pale square floor tiles, round wooden tables, additional wooden chairs, a gravel-filled tree bed, partially visible guests, a dark vertical utility fixture, metal railings, dense green foliage and cropped bags or furniture along the edges. Keep the environment slightly crowded and imperfect. Do not clean it into an empty studio or luxury hotel setting.\n\nUse mixed outdoor natural light. Warm sunlight enters from above and slightly front-left, grazing the hair, shoulders, forearms, white tank top and knees with localized bright highlights. Open sky and pale floor tiles provide soft reflected fill so the face remains evenly readable. Keep authentic occlusion shadows beneath the chin, inside the arms, behind the knees and around the chair back. No flash, no artificial rim light and no studio softbox. Maintain moderately deep focus so the subject is clearest but the tables, tiles, pillar and foliage remain recognizable.\n\nThe finished image should feel like a friend spontaneously lifted a phone and captured a fleeting summer café moment. She had been chatting a moment earlier; now her fingers are moving toward a heart, and the next second she may laugh because the gesture did not align perfectly. Preserve mild sensor grain, slight highlight clipping, real skin texture, fabric folds, edge clutter and an imperfect social-media composition. Avoid mirror-selfie framing, low angles, perfect symmetry, exaggerated body proportions, sexualized styling, plastic skin, malformed hands, extreme bokeh, heavy HDR, watermarks and platform text.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/45568_out.png"]},{"i":4504,"text":"娜美 Nami（海贼王），成年角色真人 COS，真实摄影质感，高级商业摄影风格。\n\n保留娜美核心角色识别点，包括橙色长发、棕色眼睛、成熟自信的航海士气质、草帽海贼团成员身份、性感灵动的女性魅力、航海服装风格、天候棒武器、航海地图元素、天气操控能力与海贼旗阵营符号。\n\n将娜美重新转译为精致高级真人化 COS 造型。\n设计真实可穿戴的高定航海战斗礼服：\n融合橙白蓝主色调、轻盈海洋风布料、金属腰饰、航海徽章、精致皮革配件、腿部装饰、长靴、披风与机械结构细节。\n天候棒重新设计为高级未来航海法杖，融合金属机械结构、透明水晶核心、气象科技纹路与天气能量模块。\n整体服装兼具海贼世界冒险感与高级时装摄影质感。\n\n9:16 竖版构图。\n\n人物优雅地坐在一根古典海洋遗迹石柱或雕刻底座上，身体略微侧向镜头。\n一条腿自然抬起，另一条腿向下延伸，姿态稳定、自信且具有掌控感。\n一只手轻靠脸侧，展现娜美聪慧狡黠的表情；\n另一只手握住专属武器「天候棒」，武器沿画面一侧延展，形成第二条主视觉线。\n\n人物周围悬浮一整圈与娜美高度相关的专属物件：\n\n航海罗盘、\n草帽海贼团徽章、\n航海地图碎片、\n天候棒零件、\n气象仪器、\n雷云晶体、\n太阳能量碎片、\n风元素粒子、\n海洋珍珠、\n金币、\n宝藏地图、\n航海日志、\n海图卷轴、\n贝壳饰品、\n海贼旗纹章、\n橘子树元素、\n天气魔法符文。\n\n所有悬浮物必须围绕娜美的航海士身份自动生成。\n悬浮物在造型、配色、纹样、材质与光效上统一采用：\n橙色、蓝色、金色、白色海洋配色。\n\n围绕人物形成完整环形构图，如同娜美掌控天气与海洋力量的专属领域。\n\n背景保持干净明亮的摄影棚空间，融合轻微海洋遗迹氛围：\n浅色背景、白色云雾、柔和天空光、远处模糊海洋元素。\n\n光线清晰柔和，重点照亮娜美的脸部、橙色长发、腿部线条、服装纹理、天候棒细节与悬浮物边缘高光。\n\n悬浮元素之间加入：\n轻微雷电连接、\n漂浮水珠、\n旋转风流、\n微光粒子、\n气象符文、\n透明能量丝带。\n\n整体风格：\n\n海贼王角色展示 × 高级真人 COS × 航海幻想时装大片 × 悬浮专属物设定图 × 商业级角色海报摄影。\n\n8K超清，真实皮肤纹理，电影级摄影，真实服装材质，高级杂志封面质感。","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/45543_out.png"]},{"i":4505,"text":"鱼眼广角深夜街头海报，16:9 横版——采用极限运动摄影机级别的鱼眼广角镜头，贴地仰拍构图，画面带明显桶形畸变，人物微微前倾像要探出画面；中央是[角色搭配]，二次元厚涂画风，睡眼惺忪、脸颊泛红晕染，抬头直视镜头；背景是一间真实感的[店铺类型]门面，暖黄室内灯光透出，与冷调雨后街景形成对比，地面是湿润反光的沥青路面；画面顶部横贯一行巨大黄色喷漆涂鸦风格标题\"[标题]\"，带滴漆效果，压在人物头顶后方制造纵深；地面前景散布同色喷漆涂鸦草字，与顶部标题呼应；人物左右两侧配小写英文短句\"[侧边短句]\"，缀一个小符号[符号]；整体真实摄影质感、雨后深夜氛围，画面所有文字均为英文——不要用普通平视无畸变的镜头、不要干燥地面、不要人物偏离画面中心、不要道具和店铺主题不匹配、不要标题用非喷漆字体\n\n{\n\"style_rules\": {\n\"lens_composition\": \"extreme fisheye wide-angle lens, low camera angle looking slightly up, character leaning toward viewer, strong barrel distortion bending the storefront and street — borrowed from skate/action-sports video grammar\",\n\"character\": \"single anime/manga-style character (alternating male/female), centered, messy dark hair, sleepy half-lidded eyes with blush lines, looking directly up into the lens, wearing a beige/tan jacket\",\n\"prop_match\": \"character holds objects that precisely match the shop's theme\",\n\"storefront\": \"realistic late-night or after-rain neighborhood shop storefront matching the theme, warm interior glow against cool blue exterior tones\",\n\"graffiti_title\": \"giant yellow spray-paint graffiti-style title spanning the top of frame, drip effects, positioned behind the character's head for depth\",\n\"ground_tags\": \"matching yellow/white spray-paint graffiti tags scrawled on the wet asphalt in the foreground, echoing the title's texture\",\n\"side_labels\": \"small white lowercase text phrases placed left/right of the character, diary-like short phrases, plus one small glyph/symbol accent\",\n\"ground\": \"wet reflective asphalt with visible street markings\",\n\"format\": \"16:9 horizontal\"\n},\n\"negative\": \"normal eye-level lens with no distortion, clean dry pavement, character off-center, props unrelated to the shop theme, title in a non-graffiti font, daytime lighting\",\n\"variables\": {\n\"character_gender_styling\": \"[boy holding a cat and records / girl carrying a wrapped laundry bundle / girl holding an arcade joystick and screwdriver / boy carrying canned drinks with a skateboard]\",\n\"shop_type\": \"[record shop / 24hr laundromat / retro arcade / late-night coffee cart]\",\n\"title\": \"[SIDE B / SPIN LATE / INSERT SUN / NO SLEEP]\",\n\"side_phrases\": \"[needle drop · shop open / soft static / wash all night · cold street · last load !! / free play · jammed lever / after rain / first cup · last trick · keep rolling →]\",\n\"glyph\": \"[** / (none) / ++ / arrow →]\"\n}\n}","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/45475_out.png"]},{"i":4506,"text":"FORMAT\n\n4:5 VERTICAL ULTRA-PREMIUM SOCIAL MEDIA MARKETING POSTER\n\nCREATIVE DIRECTION\n\nThis campaign must feel unmistakably ASUS Vivobook Go 15 OLED (E1504G)\n\nDo not borrow Nike's visual language.\n\nDo not imitate sneaker advertising.\n\nInstead, build the entire composition around vivobook`s own design philosophy:\n\nPrecision.\nPower.\nMinimal aggression.\nDark luxury.\nEngineered performance.\n\nThe laptop is presented as a precision machine.\n\nA weapon of focus.\n\nA tool built for domination.\n\nLuxury technology meets motorsport engineering.\n\nApple restraint.\nPorsche precision.\nasus attitude.\n\nCORE IDEA\n\nThe iconic ASUS Vivobook Go 15 OLED (E1504G) diamond becomes the entire visual architecture.\n\nNot a logo.\n\nA design system.\n\nThe diamond shape expands across the composition.\n\nMassive geometric structures.\n\nAngular light cuts.\n\nArchitectural shadows.\n\nEvery graphic element originates from the asus symbol.\n\nCustom geometric letterforms.\n\nIntegrated into the background architecture.\n\nTypography feels laser-cut from the environment.\n\nNot simply placed on top.\n\nTypography and product become one visual system.\n\nPRODUCT POSITIONING\n\nHero ASUS Vivobook Go 15 OLED (E1504G) laptop.\n\nFloating centrally.\n\nThree-quarter angle.\n\nPrecision-aligned.\n\nLuxury product rendering.\n\nControlled perspective.\n\nThe machine feels engineered.\n\nNot emotional.\n\nNot playful.\n\nA serious performance object.\n\nLike a Porsche GT3 photographed for a luxury campaign.\n\nBACKGROUND SYSTEM\n\nDeep matte black environment.\n\nDark graphite gradients.\n\nGunmetal surfaces.\n\nLarge illuminated vivobook diamond shapes.\n\nMassive architectural planes.\n\nSharp geometric shadows.\n\nPremium industrial atmosphere.\n\nSubtle fog layers.\n\nSophisticated depth.\n\nNo gaming-room aesthetics.\n\nNo RGB chaos.\n\nNo cyberpunk city.\n\nGRAPHIC DESIGN SYSTEM\n\nasus PERFORMANCE DIVISION\n\nPoster No. 08\n\nEngineered For Victory\n\nMicro technical typography.\n\nBlueprint-inspired annotations.\n\nPrecision measurement graphics.\n\nGrid references.\n\nIndustrial alignment marks.\n\nLuxury industrial design language.\n\nWorld-class Behance feature quality.\n\nCOPY HIERARCHY\n\nPrimary Headline\n\nPERFORMANCE WITHOUT LIMITS\n\nBody Copy\n\nEvery frame matters.\n\nEvery decision counts.\n\nBuilt for those who refuse compromise.\n\nVictory starts here.\n\nSPECIFICATION BLOCK\n\nIntel Core i3-N305\n\nNVMe PCIe 3.0 SSD\n\n15.6-inch FHD (1920 x 1080) OLED screen\n\nfrom 0% to 60% in roughly 49 minutes.\n\nPresented using a premium technical grid.\n\nInspired by luxury automotive specification cards.\n\nMinal.\n\nConfident.\n\nPrecise.\n\nCOLOR SYSTEM\n\nMatte black\n\nGraphite gray\n\nTitanium silver\n\nIce white\n\nSubtle electric cyan accents\n\nMinimal OMEN red accents\n\nLuxury contrast\n\nNo rainbow RGB\n\nNo neon overload\n\nLIGHTING\n\nPremium commercial product photography.\n\nPrecision spotlighting.\n\nAutomotive-grade reflections.\n\nControlled edge lighting.\n\nHard geometric highlights.\n\nDeep shadow transitions.\n\nStudio-quality rendering.\n\nCinematic contrast.\n\nDETAILING\n\nFloating shadow.\n\nArchitectural light beams.\n\nASUS diamond reflections.\n\nSubtle atmospheric haze.\n\nLuxury negative space.\n\nPerfect typography spacing.\n\nMinimal but powerful.\n\nNo clutter.\n\nNo random visual effects.\n\nNo gaming clichés.\n\nEMOTIONAL IMPRESSION\n\nA viewer should feel:\n\n\"This looks like ASUS Vivobook Go 15 OLED (E1504G).\"\n\n\"This feels engineered.\"\n\n\"This feels expensive.\"\n\n\"This feels precise.\"\n\n\"This feels powerful.\"\n\n\"I trust this machine.\"\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\nOUTPUT\n\nUltra photorealistic\n\n8K HDR\n\nLuxury commercial photography\n\nASUS VIVOBOOK brand-first design language\n\nPremium graphic design system\n\nCannes Lions quality\n\nBehance featured project\n\nMagazine cover quality\n\nHyper-detailed typography\n\nPerfect product rendering\n\nIndustrial luxury aesthetic","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/45474_out.png"]},{"i":4507,"text":"Create a vertical 3:4 timed smartphone portrait of an adult-coded young woman, visually around 20 to 25 years old, wearing a black-and-white gothic nurse and bunny-ear cosplay outfit. She is seated or leaning forward beneath a phone fixed above her on a stand. This is not a mirror selfie: the phone and stand remain outside the frame, leaving both of her hands free. Position the camera approximately 40 to 50 degrees above eye level, nearly centered in front of her and looking downward. Use the gentle perspective of a close 24 to 28 mm full-frame-equivalent smartphone lens, making the head, eyes, hands and plush ears appear prominent while the torso and waist gradually recede toward the lower frame.\n\nFrame the scene from the oversized ears down to the waist area. Place her face in the upper central region without perfect alignment or mechanical symmetry. Her head tilts subtly toward the viewer's right, and her face lifts toward the camera. Both eyes look directly into the lens. Raise both hands beside her cheeks and temples, bend the wrists gently inward and curve the fingers into a cat-paw face-framing gesture. The thumbs point toward the jaw and cheeks while the other fingers create arched frames around the face. The hand on the viewer's left sits slightly lower and the hand on the viewer's right sits slightly higher. Both elbows open outward. Maintain believable five-finger anatomy, natural joints, convincing wrist angles and small gaps between the fingers. Give her moderately long almond-shaped nails painted translucent nude pink or creamy beige.\n\nHer expression is quiet, soft and knowingly playful. The lips remain gently closed or separated by an extremely narrow gap, with the corners raised into a restrained small smile and no visible teeth. Her gaze should not appear vacant; she is consciously engaging with the camera, combining sweetness with a mild mischievous quality. Preserve the original softly rounded short-oval facial contour, naturally tapered but not sharply pointed chin, eye spacing, large eyes, narrow nose bridge, small nose tip, soft lip shape and slight natural asymmetry. Do not force an extreme V-shaped jaw, excessively raise the nose bridge or enlarge the lips.\n\nUse refined makeup inspired by Japanese jirai-kei, ryousangata and anime cosplay aesthetics without assigning a celebrity, ethnicity, nationality or identity. Apply a bright ivory complexion with a neutral-cool base that shifts into soft peach-pink under the warm indoor light. Add gray-brown circle lenses with translucent softly defined iris edges. Blend rose pink and pale mauve through the eye sockets, deepening the outer corners slightly. Draw thin black upper eyeliner with subtly lowered outer corners. Add pink shading beneath the eyes and tiny silver-white glitter around the inner corners and aegyo-sal. Keep the lashes fine and separated rather than thick and heavy. Add soft pink blush under the eyes and on the nose tip. Finish the lips with a moist semi-translucent berry-pink gradient gloss and restrained wet highlights.\n\nHer hair is dense deep black with extremely subtle dark-brown reflections under the frontal light. Thick blunt bangs cover the eyebrows, with slight natural separation along the lower edge. Long straight sections form low twin-tail or low twin-section structures on both sides, falling along the cheeks and over the chest, with ends curving gently inward. The hair should appear smooth, dense and semi-matte, deliberately styled for cosplay while retaining a few flyaways, crossing strands, uneven bang divisions and slightly mismatched ends. Avoid greasy shine or a perfectly molded plastic-wig appearance.\n\nPlace a white nurse cap at the center of the crown, displaying a prominent black cross or plus-shaped graphic, with a small amount of black lace visible behind it. Attach a pair of oversized white plush rabbit ears. The ear on the viewer's left extends outward and then hangs downward through the upper-left and left edges of the frame. The ear on the viewer's right rises over the head, arches toward the upper-right and continues beyond the frame. Do not make the ears identical. They should be thick, fluffy and soft with slightly irregular fibers. Add one black satin bow to each side of the hair, with a longer ribbon tail on the viewer's right.\n\nDress her in a cropped white high-neck top that combines nurse-uniform, gothic-maid and bunny-cosplay elements. Around the neck, include fine white ruffles, black piping, black sheer ruffle trim and a narrow black band. Hang a black cross-shaped pendant at the center with tiny silver-toned connector highlights. Run vertical black lace details along the torso and place black cross appliqués and short rectangular accents across the chest and abdomen. Finish the cropped hem with a translucent black pleated or tulle ruffle. Cover the shoulders with white short sleeve pieces, leaving one section of upper arm exposed between the short sleeve and detached sleeve on the viewer's left. Let both hands emerge from oversized white flared cuffs edged with narrow black lace.\n\nThe white material should resemble soft matte lightweight uniform cloth or a cotton blend. Let the wide sleeves form natural folds and stacked creases as the arms are raised. Keep the bodice neatly fitted but not tight. The chest remains fully covered by the high-neck garment and creates only a soft natural fabric contour, with no cleavage and no exaggerated bust. Expose only a limited strip of slim waist and lower abdomen beneath the cropped hem, mainly at the bottom center. The abdomen is naturally smooth with a gentle curve created by leaning forward, without pronounced muscles, ribs or hollow definition. Keep the lower garment almost entirely outside the frame, allowing only a small hint of black-and-white waistband, ruffle or skirt edge along the bottom. Do not invent a fully visible skirt, stockings, buttocks or legs.\n\nVisible skin consists of the full face, both hands and fingers, small portions of the wrists, one exposed upper-arm section on the viewer's lower-left side, and a limited strip of waist and lower abdomen. Only an extremely narrow area of neck appears above the central collar. Use bright ivory skin with a neutral-cool base and creamy peach transitions under the warm-white light. The facial skin should appear finely textured and soft, as though it would feel slightly cool, smooth and gently hydrated, while subtle natural variation remains beneath the eyes, beside the nose and around the lips. Apply slightly less diffusion to the hands so faint knuckle and palm-edge texture remains. The exposed upper arm and abdomen should look warm, smooth and soft to the touch, with believable tonal variation rather than waxy, rubbery or completely textureless skin.\n\nSet the portrait in a warm, slightly crowded private bedroom, small studio or cosplay preparation corner. Behind her on the left, include a wooden shelf or tabletop with stacked off-white ceramic bowls, cups or vessels. Add a brown textile, brush-like decoration or fringed soft object behind the left side. Near the upper-left edge, show part of a green cartoon print or decorative artwork. Let a small section of black lace pattern remain visible behind the nurse cap. Introduce silver tubular chair rails, shelving or furniture diagonally along the lower-left and lower edges. Behind her on the right, include an orange cartoon animal or pumpkin-colored cardboard decoration. Near the bottom, show parts of a patterned textile or cushion containing yellow, orange and green. Preserve a few household objects partially obscured by the subject, sleeves and rabbit ears. Do not reorganize the setting into a plain studio, luxury hotel or minimalist bedroom.\n\nIlluminate the scene with warm indoor ambient light combined with soft warm-white frontal fill positioned close to or slightly above the camera axis. Make the face and hands the brightest areas, while the white garment and plush ears remain slightly less luminous but retain fabric and fiber detail. Let the heavy bangs cast a shallow soft shadow over the forehead. Preserve gentle natural shadows around the nostrils, lower lip, jaw, spaces between the fingers and interiors of the sleeves. Let the under-eye glitter produce tiny point reflections, place soft square or circular catchlights inside the irises, and give the glossy lips and nails moist restrained highlights. The plush ears should show soft diffuse reflection rather than harsh glare. Do not add hard rim light, dramatic backlight, cold blue nighttime lighting or polished cinematic studio illumination.\n\nRender the portrait with believable smartphone computational processing: slightly soft, low in contrast and mildly warm, with moderate beauty diffusion on the skin while retaining recognizable detail in the eyes, lashes, hair strands, lace, fingers and nail edges. Preserve a small amount of mobile sensor noise, light JPEG compression, inconsistent background sharpness, flyaway hairs, fabric folds and edge interference. Keep the face, hands and front hair clear while allowing the more distant wooden shelf, ceramics, textiles and cartoon decorations to soften slightly but remain recognizable. Avoid ultra-clean advertising sharpness, aggressive HDR, exaggerated pore detail or flawless commercial studio polish.\n\nShe had just adjusted the nurse cap, satin bows and plush rabbit ears and had already started the timer. She is now holding both hands beside her face and looking directly into the lens with a paw-like gesture. In the next second, she may lower her hands, break into a small laugh or reach up to readjust the ear curving beyond the frame. The final image should feel like a soft, dreamy, warm and mildly mischievous social-media cosplay portrait: intimate without being explicit, carefully styled while still preserving accidental framing, slight asymmetry, minor imperfections and the lingering emotion of the previous second.\n\nNegative minor appearance, childlike proportions, mirror selfie, visible phone, phone covering face, misaligned gaze, cross-eyed, closed eyes, broad toothy smile, extreme V-shaped jaw, Western glam makeup, plastic skin, waxy skin, extreme smoothing, greasy face, oversharpened HDR, hard rim light, cold blue lighting, exposed breasts, cleavage, bare shoulders, excessive exposed waist, bare buttocks, bare legs, exaggerated bust, exaggerated curves, peace sign, heart hands, duplicated hands, extra arms, extra palms, six fingers, missing fingers, fused fingers, broken wrists, deformed nails, duplicate rabbit ears, extra animal ears, identically upright ears, missing bows, deformed crosses, plain studio, luxury bedroom, perfect symmetry, text, watermark, signature, logo.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/45294_out.png"]},{"i":4508,"text":"Create a vertical 3:4 front-facing smartphone selfie of an adult-coded young woman, visually around 18 to 24 years old, wearing a black-and-white gothic nurse cosplay. She leans close to the lens while the unseen phone is held approximately 30 to 40 degrees above eye level and pointed downward. Use a very close 24 to 28 mm full-frame-equivalent smartphone perspective that makes the face and eyes visually prominent without producing extreme distortion.\n\nHer head is lightly tilted and her face is raised toward the camera. She looks directly upward into the lens with a quiet, soft, slightly timid and faintly distant expression. Her lips remain naturally closed with relaxed, level corners and no obvious smile, preserving the feeling of a brief emotional pause. Preserve the original softly rounded, relatively short facial shape, natural jawline, eye spacing, narrow nose bridge, small nose tip and soft lip shape. Do not sharpen the chin or significantly reshape the facial proportions.\n\nHer hair is dense, deep black and mostly straight, with thick blunt bangs covering the eyebrows. Long side sections fall naturally on both sides in a low twin-section or twin-tail arrangement, with the ends curving slightly inward. The hair should appear smooth, dense and semi-matte while retaining fine flyaways, minor irregularity and believable strand texture. Place a white nurse cap at the center of the crown with a prominent black cross symbol. Oversized fluffy white animal ears extend from both sides and are irregularly cropped by the top edge of the frame. Add black satin ribbon bows on both sides of the hair.\n\nUse refined makeup inspired by Japanese jirai-kei, ryousangata and anime cosplay aesthetics without referencing a particular celebrity or assigning ethnicity. Apply a very fair neutral-cool complexion, rose-pink and pale mauve eye-shadow gradients, thin black eyeliner with subtly lowered outer corners, and gray-brown circle lenses. Add tiny silver-white glitter points at the inner corners, beneath the eyes and along the aegyo-sal area. Keep the lashes fine and separated. Apply soft pink blush beneath the eyes, across the cheeks and on the tip of the nose. Use a translucent, moist-looking pink gradient lip gloss with delicate reflective highlights.\n\nThe only visible skin should be the full face, tiny areas near the ears and a very narrow strip of upper neck above the high collar. The shoulders, arms, chest, waist, hips and legs must remain covered or outside the frame. The facial skin should appear finely textured, soft, slightly cool, smooth and gently hydrated, with mild smartphone beauty diffusion but subtle natural variation remaining beside the nose, beneath the eyes and around the lips. Avoid plastic or completely textureless skin.\n\nDress her in a white high-neck, long-sleeved cosplay top combining nurse-uniform and gothic-maid elements. Add black piping, a fine white ruffled collar, black sheer ruffles, narrow black lace details and several black cross appliqués. Around the neck, include a thin black band, black sheer ruffle trim and a hanging black cross-shaped ornament. The fabric should look soft, lightweight and matte, with small natural folds created by the close selfie posture. Do not make the garment tight or emphasize the chest. The lower garment, waist, hips and legs must not appear.\n\nKeep the framing casual and imperfect. Her face fills most of the image but is not aligned with perfect symmetry. A white-sleeved arm enters from the lower-left foreground and reaches toward the unseen phone. The oversized ears are partially cropped along the top edge, and small edge obstructions remain. Do not turn the composition into a centered passport portrait.\n\nPlace her in a warm, slightly crowded corner of a private room or small studio. Behind her on the left, include a wooden shelf with stacked off-white ceramic bowls and vessels. Near the upper-left edge, show part of a green-toned artwork or print. Add a thin metal frame or furniture structure in the rear. Along the right edge, let an orange cartoon star and animal-shaped cutout intrude into the composition, with a soft white cushion or bedding behind the right shoulder. Keep the background lived-in and mildly cluttered rather than converting it into a plain studio, minimalist room or luxury bedroom.\n\nIlluminate the scene with warm indoor ambient light combined with soft near-axis frontal fill positioned slightly above the face. Let the light illuminate the forehead, nose bridge, upper cheeks and chin while the bangs cast a faint soft shadow across the forehead. Retain gentle natural shadows around the nostrils and beneath the jaw. Let the under-eye glitter create tiny point reflections and the lip gloss produce a moist highlight. Do not add a strong rim light, dramatic backlight or polished cinematic studio setup.\n\nRender the image with believable smartphone computational processing, mild beauty-filter softness, a subtle warm cast, restrained sharpening, slight sensor noise and light JPEG compression. Keep the face and front hair sections clear while allowing the shelving, ceramics and cartoon decoration to soften slightly but remain recognizable. The image should feel as though she had just adjusted the nurse cap and bows, has already raised the phone above her, and is now looking quietly into the lens. In the next second, she may relax her expression or readjust the fluffy ear cropped by the frame. Preserve the intimacy, small imperfections, asymmetry and lingering emotion of a genuine social-media selfie.\n\nNegative minor appearance, childlike body, mirror selfie, visible phone, phone covering face, bare shoulders, cleavage, exposed chest, bare waist, bare legs, exaggerated breasts, exaggerated curves, pointed chin, Western glam makeup, plastic skin, extreme smoothing, oversharpened HDR, hard rim light, professional studio background, perfect symmetry, misaligned gaze, cross-eyed, duplicate ears, extra bows, deformed crosses, extra fingers, distorted limbs, text, watermark, logo.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/45285_out.png"]},{"i":4509,"text":"9:16, photorealistic close-up indoor portrait, soft natural window light, pale aqua wall background, low-contrast pastel color grading, gentle shadows, clean fresh lifestyle photography.\n\nYoung adult East Asian woman, long fluffy black wavy hair, loose messy strands across her face and lips, delicate doll-like face, large clear dark eyes, fair luminous skin, peach blush on cheeks and nose, glossy peach pouty lips, subtle natural makeup.\n\nShe sits casually on the floor with knees raised in the foreground, wearing a white ribbed sleeveless tank top and loose gray-green pants. Both hands lifted near her face, playful cute pout expression, looking directly at the camera, intimate candid mood, soft focus, realistic skin texture, shallow depth of field.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/45244_out.png"]},{"i":4510,"text":"围绕任意主题对象生成一张图文融合的概念画面：先让一个极粗、极大的主题核心词占据中部，字形像沉重的结构墙一样压住画面，随后用主题派生的水平环境场从字的下半部横切过去，遮住部分笔画，使文字既保持可读，又像被真实空间吞没一截。环境场前方放置一个低矮横向的主题载体和一个很小的行动符号，尺度与巨字形成强烈反差，动作安静、缓慢、像暂停在工作之外；细长的方向线或工具线穿过留白，制造斜向张力。上方保留大面积通风留白，只安排少量小字号信息线、编号和短标题，字体使用粗重压缩无衬线与打字机式微小文字组合，字距紧、边界硬、带轻微套印偏差。色彩从主题自身的材质、情绪和语义中提取，映射为大面积明亮干净的基础底色、清透的水平场色、少量高饱和强调色、深色结构阴影和低存在感信息文字，保持明亮轻快、清晰色阶、冷暖轻微对冲和干净留白；纸纹、网点、划痕只作为复古印刷触感，不让画面变灰、变脏或失去通风感。整体像一张被巨大标题压住的慢节奏瞬间，主题动作很小，信息层很大，幽默、松弛、安静，但结构必须精确。\n\n主题：完璧归赵\n配色: 符合主题的日系清新+糖果配色","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/45101_out.png"]},{"i":4511,"text":"A photorealistic woman inspired by Nico Robin from One Piece. Long wavy dark hair flows naturally in the wind. Hourglass figure with ample chest and sculpted legs. Intense magical energy swirls around both hands, illuminating her knowing expression. Cinematic lighting, dramatic storm clouds, realistic skin texture, highly detailed costume materials, volumetric lighting, shallow depth of field, 85mm lens, ultra-detailed, HDR, blockbuster movie quality.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/45048_out.png"]},{"i":4512,"text":"A young adult woman crouching inside a retro public phone booth, wearing a black-and-gray striped cat-ear knit hood and dark Y2K styling. She holds a green public phone receiver and looks up toward a camera shooting from above. The overall style mixes goth-lolita, Y2K emo, Japanese alternative doll fashion, and harsh-sunlight mobile snapshot realism.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/44550_out.png"]},{"i":4513,"text":"A young adult woman standing inside or beside a narrow retro public phone booth, wearing a black-and-gray striped cat-ear knit look. She looks upward toward the camera, mixing goth-lolita, Y2K emo, Japanese street fashion, and doll-like styling. The image feels like a close friend captured her from above with a wide-angle phone camera under harsh sunlight.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/44547_out.png"]},{"i":4514,"text":"9:16 vertical aspect ratio, highly detailed, ultra-realistic Instagram Story style selfie photograph, authentic smartphone selfie texture and grain, 8k photorealistic quality.\n\nThe subject is a young beautiful East Asian adult woman cosplaying as Ghislaine Dedoldia (Sword King from Mushoku Tensei), automatically extracting the character's representative color palette and visual symbols, transforming them into elegant qipao/cheongsam patterns and accessories. She must clearly retain Ghislaine Dedoldia's most recognizable identity features: long voluminous silver-gray hair in her signature wild yet elegant style, striking golden-amber eyes, powerful athletic swordswoman build and presence, beastkin warrior aura with subtle fierce charm, along with classic color scheme, so viewers can instantly recognize her as Ghislaine Dedoldia rather than a generic cosplayer.\n\nShe stands on a light-colored, smooth indoor marble floor with subtle soft lighting reflections. Her left hand holds a smartphone, arm fully stretched upward, phone raised high above her head, shooting a high-angle selfie looking down, creating a natural high-position selfie perspective with realistic wide-angle lens distortion. The composition feels like a casual real-life phone snapshot grab, not a posed studio poster. The character dominates the frame, clearly showing her head, upper body, waist-hip curves, and part of her legs.\n\nHer right hand is gently placed beside her face making a clear, standard \"YEAH\" hand gesture, while playfully sticking out her tongue — not a tiny cute poke, but a slightly longer, mischievous tongue out. Her expression is confident, charming, and playfully seductive, infused with Ghislaine's own strong, straightforward, and powerful sword king presence.\n\nShe features exquisite makeup with long lashes, sharp eyeliner, three-dimensional facial features, and naturally delicate skin with realistic human portrait texture. The hairstyle, hair color, and accessories are realistically reinterpreted from Ghislaine Dedoldia's original design while preserving strong character recognizability, presented as a high-end realistic cosplay photograph.\n\nThe outfit is a deep V-neck, high side-slit satin qipao-style dress redesigned based on Ghislaine Dedoldia's classic color scheme. The qipao's main color, secondary tones, piping, patterns, and decorative elements must derive from her iconic palette and visual motifs — primarily silver-gray and black with rich gold accents, subtle wolf or sword-inspired embroidery, and tribal energy lines. Deep plunging neckline, high slit design, body-hugging tailoring that accentuates her athletic figure, premium silk-satin lustrous sheen, with thematic patterns on the fabric such as elegant geometric motifs, sword engravings, beast/wolf symbols, or character-exclusive warrior decorations. Overall luxurious, sexy, powerful, and opulent while keeping Ghislaine's identity unmistakable.\n\nSoft indoor lighting, ultra-realistic skin texture with natural fine details and pores, sharp clear facial features, realistic satin reflections on the clothing and subtle reflections on the marble floor. The overall look is a high-quality authentic phone selfie: exquisite, sexy, natural, with strong character fidelity, realistic portrait photography style.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/44070_out.png"]},{"i":4515,"text":"Vertical 9:16 photorealistic full-body portrait, nostalgic Taiwanese idol drama style, early-2000s analog flash photography, soft highlight bloom, gentle halation, dreamy blur, film grain, slight noise.\n\nA young East Asian woman with a short pink bob haircut and blunt bangs wears a fitted red qipao with subtle floral jacquard texture and matching red high heels. She has a cool, cocky, rebellious expression and looks directly at the camera.\n\nFull-body composition, head-to-toe framing, her entire body visible including both legs, feet, and red high heels. Slight low-angle wide-lens perspective to make the legs look long and stylish while keeping realistic anatomy.\n\nShe stands at the entrance of a nostalgic Taiwanese snack shop with vintage Chinese signage, warm ambient light, old storefront textures, retro street atmosphere, and worn 2000s idol-drama mood.\n\nPose: both arms extended toward the camera, forming the classic C-BLOCK “以下范上” gesture. Left hand higher, palm inward, index and middle fingers pressed together pointing upward, thumb extended sideways. Right hand lower, palm inward, index and middle fingers pressed together pointing downward, thumb extended sideways crossing near the left thumb. Hands are closer to the lens but not too huge, face clearly visible between or above them.\n\nKeep fingers straight, natural, and readable. Preserve hand skin texture and clear finger details. Do not overexpose the hands. Avoid loose peace signs, single-finger pointing, claw-like hands, distorted anatomy, cropped feet, hidden shoes, or hands covering the face.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/44000_out.png"]},{"i":4516,"text":"Create a cinematic, film-production-grade character design sheet for a director, casting team, and costume department. Character name: [YOUR CHARACTER NAME HERE]. Must feel like a high-budget animated film pitch board, not a generic model sheet.\n\nCORE DIRECTIVE (NON-NEGOTIABLE): No generic layouts. No evenly spaced grids. No symmetry for symmetry's sake. Composition must feel art-directed, intentional, slightly asymmetrical. Every section must feel placed, not auto-generated.\n\nCHARACTER IDENTITY: Name: [Full name] | Alias: [Nickname or codename] | Age: [Real or stylized] | Height: [cm or ft] | Build: [Body type, proportions, posture tendencies] | Ethnicity / Design Language: [e.g. Pixar-esque, anime-inspired, culturally grounded]\n\nFACE DESIGN: Structure: [Face shape, bone structure, exaggeration level] | Skin: [Tone, texture, imperfections] | Eyes: [Size, spacing, color, expressiveness] | Hair: [Style, texture, movement, imperfections] | Distinct Features: [Scars, dimples, moles, anything unique]\n\nPSYCHOLOGICAL PROFILE: Core Traits: [3 to 5 dominant personality traits] | Internal Conflict: [What they want vs what holds them back] | Behavior Patterns: [3 habits that reveal their personality] | Emotional Baseline: [Default mood + how fast it shifts]\n\nPERFORMANCE DIRECTION: Character must feel like a real actor caught mid-moment, NOT posing. Micro-expressions required (lip tension, eye flicker, brow shift). Avoid staged symmetry. Capture transitional emotion. Body Language: [Posture tendencies] | [Movement rhythm: stiff, sharp, bouncy, dragging] | [Idle behavior: fidgeting, stillness, tension]\n\nWARDROBE: Garment 1: [fabric type, wear, imperfections] | Garment 2: [fit, distortion, stitching] | Layering logic | Footwear: [material, wear patterns] | Accessories: [items that reveal personality] | Props: [objects that reinforce who they are]\n\nMATERIAL ACCURACY: Fabrics must show stretch, stitching, wrinkles, wear. No plastic look unless intentional. Skin must have soft light interaction. Include imperfections: dirt, smudges, aging, usage marks.\n\nTURNAROUND (STRICT): Full-body front, 3/4, side, back, 3/4 back views. Identical proportions and design fidelity. No drift in face or costume across any angle.\n\nHEAD STUDY: Front (neutral) | 3/4 (primary personality) | Profile (structure) | Looking Down | Looking Up | Dynamic Angle (intense state). All expressions mid-thought, not posed.\n\nCINEMATIC PORTRAIT: Environment: [Location tied to character] | Lighting: [Practical sources, contrast level] | Color Tone: [Warm, cool, stylized] | Expression: [Specific narrative moment] | Camera: [50mm or 85mm lens, shallow depth of field, cinematic realism]\n\nLAYOUT: Clean, art-directed sheet. Neutral gray background. Include: height scale, annotation callouts, wardrobe breakdown, production notes. Must feel like a premium studio board.\n\nSTYLE: [e.g. Pixar-style stylized realism / Semi-realistic cinematic design]. Must include: appealing exaggeration, soft geometry, cinematic lighting, high emotional readability.\n\nCONSISTENCY RULE (STRICT): Face, proportions, costume, and details must remain IDENTICAL across all views. No reinterpretation between angles. Ever.\n\nOUTPUT: Extremely high detail. Sharp focus. Production-ready fidelity. Suitable for film development, merchandising, and pitch decks.\"","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/43983_out.png","https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/43983_in0.png"]},{"i":4517,"text":"A cool vintage makeup style inspired by East Asian fashion aesthetics: soft matte base, muted pink-brown eyeshadow, thin eyeliner, natural under-eye highlight, low-saturation blush, and soft rose-brown lips. Keep it slightly imperfect, with subtle smudging, darkness, and snapshot realism.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/43853_out.png"]},{"i":4518,"text":"1. json prompt版本\n\n```json\n{\n\"subject\": {\n\"description\": \"一台蓝白金配色的高机动骑士型机甲，主体像未来感圣骑士与龙骑兵结合的战斗装甲，头盔尖锐，胸甲紧凑，肩部与背部有大量金色翼状尖刺装甲，整体处于高速突进与挥剑攻击的瞬间\",\n\"mirror_rules\": \"非镜自拍画面，不需要保留手机或镜面反射逻辑；保持正面偏俯视的动态战斗构图\",\n\"age\": \"非人类机甲主体，无年龄设定\",\n\"expression\": {\n\"eyes\": {\n\"look\": \"头盔面罩以蓝色透明护目镜代替眼部，呈现冷峻、锁定目标的机械视线\",\n\"energy\": \"高度集中、锋利、带有战斗压迫感\",\n\"direction\": \"面罩朝向画面下前方，像正在向观者方向冲刺\"\n},\n\"mouth\": {\n\"position\": \"无可见嘴部，头盔下半部分被白色与金色装甲完全覆盖\",\n\"energy\": \"沉默、冷硬、无情绪外露\"\n},\n\"overall\": \"主体没有人类表情，情绪主要通过低头突进、伸手握剑、环绕能量风暴来表达，像攻击已经发动、下一秒即将命中\"\n},\n\"face\": {\n\"preserve_original\": \"保留尖角骑士头盔、蓝色镜面护目镜、白色面甲、金色额角与侧翼尖刺；不要替换成人脸或生物面孔\",\n\"makeup\": \"无妆容；视觉风格偏日系机甲动画、超级机器人、圣骑士装甲审美\"\n}\n},\n\"hair\": {\n\"color\": \"无头发\",\n\"style\": \"无发型\",\n\"effect\": \"以金色尖角、蓝白头盔与后方翼状装甲代替发丝轮廓，形成向后放射的速度感\"\n},\n\"body\": {\n\"frame\": \"修长但厚重的战斗机甲身形，胸腰比例紧凑，四肢由分段式金属关节和外骨骼装甲组成，肩背装甲极度外扩\",\n\"waist\": \"腰部被深蓝与白色装甲包覆，收束明显，便于表现高速扭转动作\",\n\"chest\": \"胸部是层叠式蓝白金装甲核心，中央有红色小型能量或徽章细节，轮廓坚硬、锐利、紧凑\",\n\"legs\": \"腿部为白色主装甲，搭配蓝色与黑色足部结构，一条腿向后拉开，一条腿被动作与剑身遮挡，呈现飞跃斩击姿态\",\n\"skin\": {\n\"visible_areas\": \"没有可见人类皮肤；全身被金属装甲、机械关节和能量特效覆盖\",\n\"tone\": \"无肤色；主体表面为冷白金属、深蓝装甲、金色电镀尖刺与蓝色透明能量材质\",\n\"texture\": \"装甲触感应是冷硬、光滑、带细微划痕的金属质地；蓝色冰晶像锋利玻璃或压缩能量结晶，触感应冰冷、坚锐、易碎但充满能量；金色部件像抛光合金，边缘锐利\",\n\"lighting_effect\": \"蓝色冰晶与剑刃发出强烈冷光，照亮白色装甲边缘；橙金色电弧像高温放电在装甲和碎石周围跳跃，形成冷暖交错的反射高光\"\n}\n},\n\"pose\": {\n\"position\": \"机甲位于画面中心偏右，身体斜向俯冲，右臂或前臂向前伸出握住蓝色长剑，剑身横穿画面右侧，形成强烈对角线\",\n\"base\": \"没有稳定站立点，主体悬浮在破碎岩地上方，像被能量旋涡托举或在空中完成突刺\",\n\"overall\": \"高速旋转突进姿态，躯干前压，肩甲和背翼向后展开，四肢被透视压缩，动作紧张、锋利、攻击性极强\"\n},\n\"clothing\": {\n\"top\": {\n\"type\": \"非布料上装，为骑士型机甲胸甲、肩甲、臂甲和背部翼状装甲\",\n\"color\": \"白色金属为主，深蓝色装甲块辅助，金色尖刺和边缘装饰\",\n\"details\": \"大型金色肩翼、尖锐护臂、分段机械手指、蓝色胸甲、红色小型核心点缀\",\n\"effect\": \"表面有强反光和边缘冷光，随着蓝色能量旋涡产生高亮轮廓，材质硬朗、精密、昂贵\"\n},\n\"bottom\": {\n\"type\": \"机甲腰甲、腿甲与足部推进式结构\",\n\"color\": \"白色腿甲、蓝色关节护片、黑色足端\",\n\"details\": \"腿部装甲分片清晰，边缘尖锐，膝部和胫部具有骑士铠甲式造型\",\n\"effect\": \"动作中被能量光拖出速度感，局部有蓝色反射和暗部阴影\"\n}\n},\n\"accessories\": {\n\"device\": \"蓝色透明能量长剑，剑身像冰晶与光束结合，贯穿画面右侧并延伸出画框\",\n\"prop\": \"环绕主体的巨大蓝色冰晶碎片、橙金色电弧轨迹、飞散岩石碎块和发光粒子\"\n},\n\"photography\": {\n\"camera_style\": \"高精度CG机甲插画感，接近动画电影关键帧或游戏宣传主视觉；镜头语言模拟超广角动态抓拍，强调透视冲击和能量运动轨迹\",\n\"angle\": \"高位俯视加斜向近距离视角，镜头从机甲前上方看向下方碎裂地面，主体正向画面外冲出\",\n\"shot_type\": \"中近景动作特写，主体几乎占据画面中央，剑、冰晶和能量环延伸到四周边缘，形成满构图\",\n\"aspect_ratio\": \"1:1 方形构图\",\n\"texture\": \"整体质感锐利、清洁、细节密集；金属装甲有硬边高光，冰晶半透明且边缘发光，背景岩石粗糙暗哑；画面带少量粒子、碎屑和高速运动模糊\",\n\"lighting\": \"主要光源来自蓝色冰晶旋涡与蓝色剑刃的冷光，辅助光来自橙金色电弧形成高温线状补光；背景环境光很低，黑蓝色暗场衬托主体，冷暖能量光在装甲边缘产生强烈轮廓反射\",\n\"depth_of_field\": \"景深较深但有局部动感模糊，主体机甲和近处剑身清晰，外围旋转冰晶、飞石和能量弧带有轻微速度拖影\"\n},\n\"background\": {\n\"setting\": \"黑暗的破碎岩石战场或宇宙深空般的碎裂地表，地面像被能量攻击撕开\",\n\"wall_color\": \"无墙面，背景主色为深黑、暗蓝和岩石灰\",\n\"elements\": [\n\"破碎岩块\",\n\"飞散碎石\",\n\"暗色裂开的地面\",\n\"蓝色冰晶能量刃\",\n\"橙金色电弧\",\n\"星点般的微小光粒\",\n\"旋涡状能量轨迹\"\n],\n\"atmosphere\": \"战斗已经爆发后的瞬间，空气像被冰冷能量切开，同时又有电弧灼烧的高温残留，压迫、凌厉、速度极快\",\n\"lighting\": \"环境本身几乎无光，所有可见形体主要被蓝色能量冷光和橙色电火花照亮，形成强对比、强边缘光和局部过曝\"\n},\n\"the_vibe\": {\n\"energy\": \"爆发、高速、锋利、压迫感强\",\n\"mood\": \"冷冽而炽烈，像一次必杀技已经释放，画面停在能量撕裂空间的刹那\",\n\"aesthetic\": \"日系超级机甲、圣骑士装甲、冰晶魔法、科幻战斗游戏主视觉、夸张透视动画关键帧\",\n\"authenticity\": \"虽然是CG幻想画面，但要保留真实镜头感：透视夸张但不完全对称，能量轨迹有速度拖影，碎石大小不均，边缘有少量遮挡和偶然飞散粒子\",\n\"intimacy\": \"距离感较近，观者像被卷入机甲突进路径中，剑刃几乎从画面右侧擦过\",\n\"story\": \"它刚刚从黑暗战场中跃起，蓝色冰晶风暴已经环绕成圆，橙色电弧仍在空气里燃烧，下一秒长剑将完成斩击\",\n\"caption_energy\": \"必杀技释放瞬间、冰蓝圣骑士降临、撕裂黑暗的高速突刺\"\n},\n\"constraints\": {\n\"must_keep\": [\n\"蓝白金骑士型机甲主体\",\n\"尖锐金色肩翼和头盔角\",\n\"蓝色透明护目镜面甲\",\n\"蓝色冰晶长剑横向穿过画面\",\n\"环形蓝色能量旋涡\",\n\"橙金色电弧轨迹\",\n\"黑暗破碎岩石背景\",\n\"俯视斜向动态构图\",\n\"强烈冷暖对比光\",\n\"大量飞散碎石和粒子\",\n\"方形画幅\",\n\"高精度机甲CG插画质感\"\n],\n\"avoid\": [\n\"不要改成人类角色\",\n\"不要加入裸露皮肤\",\n\"不要变成写实真人盔甲\",\n\"不要弱化蓝色冰晶能量\",\n\"不要移除橙色电弧\",\n\"不要使用平静站立姿势\",\n\"不要使用干净空背景\",\n\"不要让构图过于居中静态\",\n\"不要变成低细节玩具模型\",\n\"不要让装甲变得圆润卡通\"\n]\n},\n\"negative_prompt\": [\n\"人脸\",\n\"裸露皮肤\",\n\"真人\",\n\"低清晰度\",\n\"低细节\",\n\"塑料玩具感\",\n\"静态站姿\",\n\"空白背景\",\n\"过度柔焦\",\n\"比例错误\",\n\"装甲融化\",\n\"剑身弯曲\",\n\"能量特效杂乱\",\n\"颜色发灰\",\n\"无透视冲击\",\n\"无碎石\",\n\"无电弧\"\n]\n}\n```\n\n2. 结合json整理成「中文」语言自然语言表达的prompt\n\n一台蓝白金配色的高机动骑士型机甲正在黑暗破碎的岩石战场中高速突进，主体像未来圣骑士与龙骑兵结合的战斗装甲。保留尖锐的金色头盔角、蓝色透明护目镜、白色面甲、大型金色肩翼与背部翼状尖刺装甲。机甲全身没有任何人类皮肤，全部由冷白金属、深蓝装甲、金色电镀尖刺和机械关节组成；装甲触感应是冰冷、坚硬、光滑且带细微划痕的金属，蓝色冰晶像锋利透明玻璃或压缩能量结晶，冷而锐利，橙金色电弧则像高温放电在空气中灼烧。\n\n画面采用正方形构图，高位俯视加斜向近距离视角，模拟超广角动态抓拍。机甲位于画面中心偏右，身体向画面下前方俯冲，前臂伸出握住一把蓝色透明能量长剑，剑身横向贯穿画面右侧并延伸出画框，形成强烈对角线。躯干前压，肩甲和背翼向后展开，四肢因透视产生压缩感，像必杀技已经释放、下一秒就会命中目标。\n\n主体周围环绕巨大的蓝色冰晶能量旋涡，多个半透明冰晶刃片沿圆形轨迹高速旋转，外围穿插橙金色电弧和发光粒子。蓝色冷光从冰晶、剑刃和能量环中向外照亮白色装甲边缘，橙色电弧提供高温线状补光，在金色尖刺和金属边缘上形成强烈冷暖反射。背景环境光很低，主色为深黑、暗蓝和岩石灰，地面碎裂，飞散碎石大小不均，带有轻微动感模糊和偶然遮挡，保留真实镜头般的不完全对称与高速混乱感。\n\n整体质感为高精度CG机甲插画、动画电影关键帧、科幻战斗游戏主视觉。装甲边缘锐利，冰晶半透明且带蓝色发光边，岩石背景粗糙暗哑，画面细节密集但主体清晰。氛围冷冽而炽烈，像机甲刚刚从黑暗战场中跃起，冰蓝能量风暴已经卷成圆环，橙色电弧仍在空气里燃烧，长剑正要完成一次撕裂空间的高速斩击。\n\n避免出现人脸、真人、裸露皮肤、静态站姿、空白背景、低细节玩具感、过度柔焦、装甲融化、剑身弯曲、颜色发灰或缺少透视冲击。必须保留蓝白金骑士型机甲、蓝色冰晶长剑、环形蓝色能量旋涡、橙金色电弧、黑暗破碎岩石背景、俯视斜向动态构图和强烈冷暖对比光。","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/43852_out.png"]},{"i":4519,"text":"Long Commercial luxury product photography poster, photorealistic, ultra high detail, 8K quality. A gradient deep violet glass base in royal purple and electric blue gradually transitioning to a lighter cyan at the top. The bottle is placed on a trunk with dark moss and tiny ferns appearing in the scene. Name of brand \"Eye+\" Low angle 45° side camera view to make the bottle feel tall and powerful. The bottom of the bottle is partially visible. Realistic water droplets in air, around the bottle and in background, the bottle has a matte midnight blue cap. With a few drops falling, frozen mid-drip for a time-stopped effect. Background with no texture. Soft, even studio lighting with clean reflections, premium advertising look, sharp focus, realistic materials, no distractions. Light refraction & retention at the bottom of the bottle contact with glass. Big text vertically stretched EYE+ in white and a lot of small text in background in white product description, advantages in product. Etc.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/43842_out.png"]}];